Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:40:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] build: add provenance_gate policy engine component

Pure-function policy engine (Evaluate) for the provenance gate:
- Mode A (block_on_detect): render unless a detector fires; verifier-down fails open
- Mode B (provenance_required): trusted C2PA manifest required, fail-closed
- Classifier-only blocks need >=800 chars + >=0.98 confidence and stay user-overridable

12 unit tests, dual-build: chromium gtest AND standalone (-DSTANDALONE_TEST).

Series 0001 of 7. See patches/SERIES.md on yubi-OS/chromium-provenance.
